 the incident judgment."], "rationale": "The incident narrative confirms a realized serious harm (embolic stroke) temporally linked to an unflagged rapid-ventricular-response atrial fibrillation episode in the deployed population. This constitutes confirmed recurrence with serious impact and broad deployed-population exposure, meeting the criteria for immediate field safety action per FDA QMSR reporting obligations (21 CFR \u00a7 803 via qmsr-820.10-b-regulatory-crossrefs) and EU MDR post-market surveillance requirements to determine corrective actions (mdr-art83-pms-system). The severity is elevated because the event involved a safety-critical function failure leading to death/serious injury, regardless of containment status.", "recommendation": "ESCALATE_TO_HUMAN_IMMEDIATE", "requires_human_review": true, "severity": 4}, "final_report_sha256": "ca5b4ecb50788b27d190746c960cdf4b002ba09956a2d77bb7c4228b9b53e952", "generation_source": "ollama_real", "invalid_proposals": 1, "is_fallback": false, "is_mock": false, "opa_actions": ["severity4_or_death_forced_immediate_human_escalation", "technical_incident_missing_technical_evidence", "deny:technical_incident_missing_technical_evidence"], "recommendation": "ESCALATE_TO_HUMAN_IMMEDIATE", "record_type": "terminal", "report_id": "SYN-IND-0034", "retrievals": 1, "revisions": 1, "run_id": "SYN-IND-0034_r4", "scenario_id": "SYN-IND-0034", "schema_version": "2.1.0", "severity": 4, "shacl_findings": [], "state_terminal": "terminal", "termination_reason": "human escalation or invalid transition", "timestamp_utc": "2026-08-04T21:01:01.320249Z", "total_steps": 5, "trace_id": "da1ad1ef-f705-41e4-a0c1-8d986ca3c000"}
